    "text": "Bold title line of a tooltip shown to a regular user who hovers an app (Rooms, Forms, AI Agents) that the administrator has switched off on a self-hosted portal. The tooltip appears over the app card on the Dashboard and over the app item in the left sidebar. Followed by the line \"Contact your workspace administrator to enable it.\" Short status statement, no trailing period.",
